within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.N_NervousSystem.N05C_HypnoticsAndSedatives.N05CD08_Midazolam;
model Midazolam_FloresPrez2023_PD_bis
  "sigmoid_emax exposure-response sweep — Flores-Pérez_2023 :: BIS (Bispectral Index)"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep(
    E0 = 57.63,      // [1]
    Emax = -0.088,  // [1]
    EC50 = 1.357e-05,  // [kg/m3; ng/mL × 1e-06]
    gamma = 1,
    exposure_per_s = 1e-06);   // 1 ng/mL per second
  // imax_as_negative_emax: Imax (Q323) enters SigmoidEmaxSweep as −Emax
  // defaulted: gamma
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 140, Interval = 0.28),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>Midazolam_FloresPrez2023_PD_bis</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Flores-Pérez C et al., <i>Pharmaceutics 15(11)</i> 2023 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.3390/pharmaceutics15112565\">doi:10.3390/pharmaceutics15112565</a>) — Bispectral Index against midazolam ng/mL — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: sigmoid_emax.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    =      57.63          drug-free response (baseline) (E0, Q324)
  Emax  =      0.088          maximal effect term (Imax, Q323)
  EC50  =      13.57 ng/mL    exposure at half of the maximal effect term (IC50, Q322)
  gamma = (library default) Hill coefficient</pre><p>The algebra is <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep\">SigmoidEmaxSweep</a>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one ng/mL of midazolam per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 57.63   (drug-free)
  exposure = EC50 (13.57 ng/mL)  response 57.59
  exposure -> infinity  response 57.54</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Flores-Pérez_2023: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: accepted with caveats</li></ul></body></html>"));
end Midazolam_FloresPrez2023_PD_bis;
